{"key":"ImageWindow","text":"## ImageWindow\n\nThe **Image Viewer** displays images dropped onto it and lets you save or\nexport them in PNG or JPG format.\n\n---\n\n@layout\nTitle Bar | 0.50, 0.04 | Right-click for Save to GitHub or Export (Download). Click the PNG/JPG toggle to switch the save format — the file extension in the title bar updates to reflect the chosen format.\nImage Viewer | 0.50, 0.55 | Displays the image scaled to fit the window (ScaleToFit). Drop a PNG, JPG, GIF, BMP, or TGA file onto the NOS desktop or dock to open it here.\n\n---\n\n### Opening Images\n\nDrop an image file onto the NOS desktop or dock.  Supported formats:\n**PNG**, **JPG / JPEG**, **GIF** (first frame), **BMP**, **TGA**.\n\n---\n\n### Format Toggle\n\nClick the **PNG / JPG** button in the title bar to switch the save format.\n\n- The file extension in the title bar updates to reflect the chosen format\n- On save or export, the image is re-encoded in the chosen format\n\n---\n\n### Save & Export\n\n- **Right-click the title bar** → **Save to GitHub** — saves the image to your GitHub-backed file storage\n- **Right-click the title bar** → **Export (Download)** — downloads the file to your browser's download folder\n\n---","screenshot":""}